<fo:block id="W0043-09-0037-pa-060f" text-align="justify" font-size="12pt" text-indent="0em"><fo:inline baseline-shift="super" font-size="9pt" font-weight="bold" id="#W0043-09-0037-nm-04df"><fo:basic-link color="#0a0c75" internal-destination="W0043-09-0037-nm-04df">247</fo:basic-link></fo:inline><fo:inline> </fo:inline><fo:inline font-family="serif" font-size="18pt" space-before="0.1mm" space-after="0.1mm">V</fo:inline>Alida non e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t. Quia tum te<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tis gerit officium. At te<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>tis e<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline><fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>e non pote<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>t excommunicatus non toleratus. Sic nonnulli non infimæ notæ, nimium tamen textui adhærentes.</fo:block>
