<fo:block id="W0043-09-0196-it-0749" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>An obligetur qui<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>que quolibet die fe<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>to Dilectionis actum elicere. ibidem<fo:inline> </fo:inline>numero 172</fo:block>
