<fo:block id="W0043-09-0197-it-07a0" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Et effectus completus, &amp; con<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ummatus. p. 187.<fo:inline> </fo:inline>n. 10.</fo:block>
