<fo:block id="W0043-09-0197-it-07a9" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Peccat contra ius diuinum qui excommunicato Sacramenta mini<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>trat. ibid. n. 22.</fo:block>
