<fo:block id="W0043-09-0197-it-07b4" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>In quot peccet qui cum excommunicato vitando communicat. ibid. n. 45.</fo:block>
