<fo:block id="W0043-09-0204-it-0932" text-align="justify" start-indent="16pt" space-before="0.2cm" space-after="0.2cm"><fo:inline> </fo:inline>Quot in ca<fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>ibus cum iudæis <fo:inline font-weight="normal">s</fo:inline>peciatim prohibeatur communicatio p. 8. n. 54.</fo:block></fo:block></fo:block>
